|term[designator] :status settled :defined-by def-descriptors :anchor descriptor-kinds
  :word designator
  :synonyms [rigid-designator]
  :avoid [name identifier label]
  A minted name bound to its [[term/referent]] by convention — the binding, not the referent's properties, is the whole connection.
  |invariants
    - Is a kind of [[term/descriptor]]
    - Is the dual of [[term/description]]
    - Held by exactly one [[term/naming-community]]
    - Fails by dangling or colliding — never by silent re-satisfaction
